    max_count = max(dup_counts, key=lambda x: x[1])
    duplicates = [value for value, count in dup_counts if count == max_count[1]]
    non_duplicates = [value for value, count in dup_counts if count != max_count[1]]

    return duplicates, non_duplicates
```

